bremen_caption_en: [11]string = .["Town Musicians of Bremen", "An old donkey sets off for Bremen to make music.", "On the way, he meets a tired dog. “Come with me!” says the donkey.", "They meet a little cat who feels sad. She joins their journey.", "A rooster crows on a gate. He wants to make music too!", "The four friends walk through the woods as the sun goes down.", "In the twilight, they see a cozy cottage with a light in the window.", "The dog climbs onto the donkey, the cat onto the dog, and the rooster onto the cat.", "They sing together! The surprised robbers hurry away.", "The friends enjoy a meal, then find cozy places to sleep.", "The four friends make music together in their happy new home."];
